{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(tuple_input: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if all elements in the input tuple have the same data type.\n    Raises TypeError if the input is not a tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(tuple_input, tuple):\n        raise TypeError(\"check_type expects a tuple as input.\")\n\n    if len(tuple_input) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    first_type = type(tuple_input[0])\n    for element in tuple_input[1:]:\n        if type(element) != first_type:\n            return False\n    return True"}
