{"task_id": "Mbpp/230", "solution": "class InputString:\n    def __init__(self, value: str):\n        self.value = value\n\nclass ReplacementCharacter:\n    def __init__(self, value: str):\n        self.value = value\n\nclass OutputString:\n    def __init__(self, value: str):\n        self.value = value\n\nclass ReplaceBlankFunction:\n    def execute(self, input: InputString, replacement: ReplacementCharacter) -> OutputString:\n        if input.value == \"\":\n            return OutputString(\"\")\n        \n        result_chars = [replacement.value if ch == ' ' else ch for ch in input.value]\n        return OutputString(''.join(result_chars))\n\ndef replace_blank(input_string, replacement_char):\n    \"\"\"\n    Replaces blank spaces in the input string with the specified character.\n    \"\"\"\n    input_obj = InputString(input_string)\n    replacement_obj = ReplacementCharacter(replacement_char)\n    result_obj = ReplaceBlankFunction().execute(input_obj, replacement_obj)\n    return result_obj.value"}
